# BizGuides - Environment Configuration Template
# Note: For Chrome Extension runtime, the Gemini API Key is configured via the Side Panel Settings UI.
# If integrating with external servers or CI/CD testing pipelines, configure the following variables:

# Google Gemini API Key (Optional: for AI multi-city geographic expansion and personalized outreach hooks)
# Get a free key at: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# Extension Environment: production | development
NODE_ENV=production
